'''Primeval Cyclone''' (エンシェントサイクロン, ''Enshento Saikuron'', '''Ancient Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] introduced in [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Typhoon Nemo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Primeval Cyclone
|image = E 438.png
|appearance = [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Typhoon Nemo]]<br>
[[Typhoon Nihil]]<br>[[Infernal Tower/Floor 38|Infernal Tower - Floor 38]]<br>[[Infernal Tower/Floor 42|Infernal Tower - Floor 42]]<br>[[Relic Citadel/Floor 8]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Compared to other [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s, Primeval Cyclone moves very fast at 18 speed and curses everything it hits. However, it has a relatively low damage output (7,777), which allows it to be stopped via [[Weaken|weaken]]. This applies before the activation of its [[Strengthen|strengthen]] ability, which triples its damage to 23,331 per hit.

==Strategy==
[[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ultra Delinquent Cat]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] and Talented [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Doctor Cat]] can be used for crowd-control, while [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] can help deal damage when Primeval Cyclone is subdued. Strategies based around [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] may need a [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]] in order to work.

[[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Prof. Cat Jobs]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and "Weaken" Effects Up [[Cat Combo|Combos]] (ex. [[Power of Darkness (Combo)|Power of Darkness]], [[Cat High (Combo)|Cat High]]) is another way to defeat it, as he can weaken this enemy's damage to a pathetic 77. If you decide to use Prof. Cat Jobs, it is important you '''DO NOT''' bring Thaumaturge Cat, Talented Slapstick Cats, [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] or any other cat that can weaken Relic enemies, as their effects will override Prof. Cat Jobs's superior weaken ability.

